---
import { readFileSync } from 'node:fs';

// Read activation language and release details from the canonical specification.
const specification = readFileSync(new URL('../../SEEING.md', import.meta.url), 'utf8');
const release = specification.match(/\*\*Version (.+?)\*\*/)?.[1];
const conversationPrompt = specification.match(/Then tell the AI:\n\n> (.+)/)?.[1];
if (!release || !conversationPrompt) throw new Error('Check SEEING.md activation language before publishing the guide.');
const title = 'How It Works — SEEING.md';
const description = 'How SEEING.md works: AI scales what we see, so make the first interpretation visible before it becomes action.';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#000000" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://seeing.md/how-it-works/" />
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://seeing.md/images/how-it-works/ai-begins-before-the-system.webp" />
    <meta property="og:image:alt" content="AI begins before the system. What shaped the intent?" />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://seeing.md/how-it-works/" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Google+Sans+Flex:wdth,wght@75..125,100..1000&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <script src="https://scripts.withcabin.com/hello.js" async defer></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.usefathom.com/script.js" data-site="MWASYWBA" defer></script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#narrative">Skip to content</a>
    <header class="site-header">
      <div class="wrap header-inner">
        <a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="SEEING.md home">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" width="20" height="20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 4H4V28H28V10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.2" /></svg>
          <span>SEEING.md</span>
        </a>
        <button id="presentation-toggle" class="quiet-button" aria-pressed="false" hidden>Presentation view</button>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main id="narrative" tabindex="-1">
      <section class="chapter opening" id="the-shift" aria-labelledby="opening-title" data-chapter>
        <div class="wrap chapter-grid">
          <div class="copy">
            <h1 id="opening-title" tabindex="-1">AI scales what we see. <br /><span class="muted">And what we don’t.</span></h1>
            <p>Before we ask AI what to do, we’ve often already decided what we’re looking at. The difficult person. The failing project. The change everyone needs to accept.</p>
            <p>AI carries that picture forward with greater speed and reach. For leaders and teams, a decision made on an unexamined picture now travels further than ever.</p>
            <a class="text-link" href="#the-file">See how it works <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
          </div>
          <figure>
            <a class="image-expand" href="/images/how-it-works/ai-begins-before-the-system.webp" data-expand-image>
              <img src="/images/how-it-works/ai-begins-before-the-system.webp" width="3840" height="2160" fetchpriority="high" alt="AI begins before the system. What shaped the intent? Seeing leads to intent, system, and scale." />
              <span class="visually-hidden">Expand image</span>
            </a>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="chapter" id="the-file" aria-labelledby="file-title" data-chapter>
        <div class="wrap chapter-grid">
          <div class="copy">
            <h2 id="file-title" tabindex="-1">Make the first <br />interpretation visible.</h2>
            <p>An interpretation can arrive so quickly that it feels like the situation itself. SEEING.md is a portable file for people and AI that brings it into view before it becomes action.</p>
            <p>Once it’s visible, you can keep it, refine it, or let it go, before AI makes it bigger.</p>
            <p class="muted">You can begin without AI. Bring to mind something you feel sure you understand. Ask what you’ve already decided it means.</p>
          </div>
          <figure>
            <a class="image-expand" href="/images/how-it-works/the-space-before-seeing-again.webp" data-expand-image>
              <img src="/images/how-it-works/the-space-before-seeing-again.webp" width="3840" height="2160" loading="lazy" alt="Notice and question. A space marked not knowing. Then see again and act." />
              <span class="visually-hidden">Expand image</span>
            </a>
            <figcaption>Notice → Question → See again → Act. An orientation, not a formula.</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="chapter example" id="an-example" aria-labelledby="example-title" data-chapter>
        <div class="wrap">
          <h2 id="example-title" tabindex="-1">Same request. <br />A different first step.</h2>
          <blockquote class="request">Our engagement scores dropped. Give me ten initiatives to raise them.</blockquote>
          <div class="example-grid">
            <div>
              <h3>Without SEEING.md</h3>
              <p class="response">Here are ten initiatives: recognition programmes, flexible working, career conversations, a listening tour, manager training, and five more, each with a first step.</p>
              <p class="muted">Fast and credible. No one looked at what people were saying.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3>With SEEING.md</h3>
              <p class="response">The request treats the score as the problem. Before choosing initiatives, do you know what people were telling you with it? If you share the comments or what you’ve heard, I can help you find what matters most, then choose what to do about it.</p>
              <p class="muted">Initiatives may still be needed. Now they answer what people said.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="small muted">Illustrative responses, condensed.</p>
          <p class="closing-question">Bring to mind a request of your own. What has it already decided?</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="chapter try" id="try-it" aria-labelledby="try-title" data-chapter>
        <div class="wrap">
          <h2 id="try-title" tabindex="-1">One file. <br />One real question.</h2>
          <div class="try-grid">
            <div>
              <ol class="steps">
                <li><strong>Download SEEING.md.</strong><span>A plain text file. No technical experience needed.</span></li>
                <li><strong>Attach it.</strong><span>Add it to an AI conversation or your project’s files.</span></li>
                <li><strong>Ask the AI to read it.</strong><span>Copy the instruction, then bring a real decision, brief, or question.</span></li>
              </ol>
              <a class="button" href="/SEEING.md" download>Download SEEING.md</a>
              <p class="small muted">Version {release} · Free under CC BY 4.0. A lens, not the lens: it can’t guarantee clear seeing or resolve every AI risk.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="prompt-column">
              <h3>The instruction</h3>
              <blockquote id="conversation-prompt">{conversationPrompt}</blockquote>
              <button class="quiet-button copy-button" data-copy="conversation-prompt" hidden>Copy instruction</button>
              <p class="small muted">Routine work stays routine. You decide what to act on.</p>
              <p class="small muted">Hold it with relaxed diligence: high standards, without strain.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p id="copy-status" class="small" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="chapter continue" id="continue" aria-labelledby="continue-title" data-chapter>
        <div class="wrap">
          <h2 id="continue-title" tabindex="-1">The practice begins <br />before the file.</h2>
          <p class="measure">SEEING.md grew from <em>The Perception Miracle</em> and more than 500 explorations.</p>
          <div class="destinations">
            <a href="https://seedifferent.xyz/#seeing-first" rel="noopener"><span>Seeing First</span><span class="muted">A private 30 minutes for leaders and teams <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a>
            <a href="https://seedifferent.xyz/#book" rel="noopener"><span>The Perception Miracle</span><span class="muted">Explore the book <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a>
            <a href="https://seedifferent.xyz/" rel="noopener"><span>SEE DIFFERENT</span><span class="muted">Discover the wider work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a>
          </div>
          <a class="text-link" href="/">Return to SEEING.md <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <dialog id="image-dialog" class="image-dialog" aria-labelledby="image-dialog-title">
      <div class="image-dialog-inner">
        <div class="image-dialog-header">
          <p id="image-dialog-title">Expanded image</p>
          <button id="close-image" class="quiet-button" type="button" autofocus>Close <span aria-hidden="true">×</span></button>
        </div>
        <img id="expanded-image" alt="" />
      </div>
    </dialog>

    <nav id="presentation-controls" class="presentation-controls" aria-label="Presentation" hidden>
      <button id="previous-chapter" class="quiet-button" aria-label="Previous section">← Previous</button>
      <span id="chapter-counter" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">1 / 5</span>
      <button id="next-chapter" class="quiet-button" aria-label="Next section">Next →</button>
    </nav>
    <footer><div class="wrap footer-inner"><span>© 2026 <a href="https://billfox.co/" rel="author noopener">Bill Fox</a></span><span>Images from <em>The Perception Miracle</em></span><a href="mailto:hello@seeing.md">hello@seeing.md</a></div></footer>
    <script>import '../scripts/how-it-works';</script>
  </body>
</html>

<style is:global>
  :root { --ink:#000; --paper:#fff; --amber:#aa6600; --w80:rgba(255,255,255,.8); --w60:rgba(255,255,255,.6); --w15:rgba(255,255,255,.15); --gutter:clamp(20px,4vw,80px); --content:1280px; --s30:clamp(20px,3vw,30px); --s40:clamp(30px,4vw,40px); --s60:clamp(40px,6vw,60px); --s80:clamp(60px,8vw,80px); --s100:clamp(70px,10vw,100px); }
  * { box-sizing:border-box; }
  [hidden] { display:none !important; }
  html { scroll-behavior:smooth; scroll-padding-top:100px; }
  body { margin:0; background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper); font-family:"Google Sans Flex",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.75; letter-spacing:.01em; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; }
  h1,h2,h3,p,figure,blockquote { margin:0; }
  h1,h2,h3 { font-weight:500; text-wrap:balance; letter-spacing:0; }
  h1,h2 { font-size:clamp(36px,3.8vw,48px); line-height:1; }
  h1 { font-size:clamp(40px,4.2vw,60px); }
  h3 { font-size:18px; line-height:1.5; }
  p { text-wrap:pretty; }
  a { color:inherit; text-underline-offset:3px; text-decoration-thickness:1px; }
  button { font:inherit; cursor:pointer; }
  a,button { -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent; }
  :focus-visible { outline:2px solid var(--paper); outline-offset:5px; }
  h1:focus,h2:focus,main:focus { outline:none; }
  .wrap { width:100%; max-width:var(--content); margin-inline:auto; }
  .site-header,.chapter,footer { padding-inline:var(--gutter); }
  .site-header { border-bottom:1px solid var(--w15); }
  .header-inner { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; min-height:80px; gap:20px; }
  .wordmark { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; font-size:16px; line-height:1; font-weight:500; text-decoration:none; white-space:nowrap; }
  .wordmark svg { flex:none; }
  .quiet-button { color:var(--paper); background:transparent; border:1px solid var(--amber); padding:14px 20px; min-height:44px; font-size:12px; line-height:1.25; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:.05em; text-transform:uppercase; transition:border-color 250ms ease-out,background 250ms ease-out; }
  .quiet-button:hover { background:var(--amber); }
  .quiet-button:disabled { opacity:.5; cursor:default; background:transparent; }
  .skip-link { position:fixed; top:12px; left:20px; z-index:10; transform:translateY(-200%); background:var(--paper); color:var(--ink); padding:10px 20px; }
  .skip-link:focus { transform:none; }
  .chapter { padding-block:var(--s100); border-bottom:1px solid var(--w15); scroll-margin-top:0; }
  .chapter-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr); gap:var(--s80); align-items:center; }
  .copy { max-width:640px; }
  .visually-hidden { position:absolute; width:1px; height:1px; overflow:hidden; clip:rect(0 0 0 0); white-space:nowrap; }
  .copy > p,.measure { margin-top:var(--s30); color:var(--w80); }
  .muted { color:var(--w60) !important; }
  figure { min-width:0; }
  figure img { display:block; width:100%; height:auto; border:1px solid var(--w15); }
  .image-expand { display:block; text-decoration:none; cursor:zoom-in; }
  .image-dialog { width:calc(100vw - 40px); max-width:1280px; max-height:calc(100dvh - 40px); margin:auto; padding:20px; border:1px solid var(--w15); background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper); overflow:auto; }
  .image-dialog::backdrop { background:rgba(0,0,0,.8); }
  .image-dialog-inner { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:20px; }
  .image-dialog-header { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:20px; }
  #image-dialog-title { max-width:960px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; color:var(--w80); }
  #close-image { flex:none; }
  #expanded-image { display:block; width:100%; height:auto; max-height:calc(100dvh - 160px); object-fit:contain; }
  .image-expanded { overflow:hidden; }
  figcaption { margin-top:20px; color:var(--w60); font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; }
  .text-link { display:inline-block; margin-top:var(--s40); font-size:16px; }
  .text-link span { margin-left:10px; }
  .text-link:hover,footer a:hover { color:var(--w60); }
  .example-grid,.try-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr); gap:var(--s80); margin-top:var(--s60); }
  .example .request { max-width:640px; font-size:clamp(24px,2.4vw,30px); line-height:1.5; margin-top:var(--s60); padding-left:20px; border-left:1px solid var(--amber); }
  .example-grid h3 { font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.05em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--w60); }
  .example-grid > div:last-child h3 { color:var(--amber); }
  .example .response { margin-top:20px; font-size:20px; line-height:1.5; color:var(--w80); }
  .example-grid p.muted { margin-top:var(--s30); font-size:16px; }
  .closing-question { max-width:640px; margin-top:var(--s60); font-size:24px; line-height:1.5; }
  .steps { list-style:none; counter-reset:steps; margin:0; padding:0; }
  .steps li { counter-increment:steps; position:relative; padding-left:40px; margin-bottom:var(--s30); }
  .steps li::before { content:counter(steps,decimal-leading-zero); position:absolute; left:0; top:3px; font-size:12px; color:var(--w60); }
  .steps strong { display:block; font-weight:500; }
  .steps span { display:block; font-size:16px; color:var(--w80); margin-top:10px; }
  .button { display:inline-flex; justify-content:center; align-items:center; padding:20px 30px; background:var(--amber); color:var(--paper); border:1px solid var(--amber); font-size:12px; font-weight:500; line-height:1; letter-spacing:.05em; text-transform:uppercase; text-decoration:none; transition:background 250ms ease-out; }
  /* On black, gold stays a mark: the hover keeps white text inside the gold border. */
  .button:hover { background:transparent; color:var(--paper); }
  .small { font-size:14px; line-height:1.75; margin-top:20px; }
  .prompt-column blockquote { font-size:16px; color:var(--w80); border-left:1px solid var(--amber); padding-left:20px; margin-top:20px; }
  .copy-button { margin-top:20px; }
  #copy-status:empty { margin:0; }
  .measure { max-width:640px; }
  .destinations { margin-top:var(--s60); max-width:960px; }
  .destinations a { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:20px; padding-block:var(--s30); border-top:1px solid var(--w15); text-decoration:none; }
  .destinations a:last-child { border-bottom:1px solid var(--w15); }
  .destinations a > span:first-child { font-size:24px; line-height:1.25; }
  .destinations a > span:last-child { font-size:14px; }
  .destinations a:hover > span:first-child { text-decoration:underline; text-underline-offset:5px; }
  footer { padding-block:var(--s40); color:var(--w60); font-size:14px; }
  .footer-inner { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:space-between; gap:20px; }
  .presentation-controls { position:fixed; bottom:0; left:0; right:0; z-index:4; display:flex; justify-content:center; align-items:center; gap:30px; padding:16px var(--gutter); background:var(--ink); border-top:1px solid var(--w15); }
  #chapter-counter { font-size:14px; color:var(--w60); font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; min-width:40px; text-align:center; }
  .presenting .site-header { position:sticky; top:0; z-index:4; background:var(--ink); }
  .presenting .chapter { min-height:calc(100svh - 80px); display:flex; align-items:center; padding-block:var(--s60) calc(var(--s60) + 80px); border-bottom:0; }
  .presenting footer { display:none; }
  @media (min-width:1100px) and (min-height:800px) { .presenting .chapter-grid { grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.85fr) minmax(0,1.15fr); } }
  @media (max-width:900px) {
    .chapter-grid,.example-grid,.try-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:var(--s60); }
    .copy { max-width:640px; }
    figure { max-width:960px; }
    h1 br,h2 br { display:none; }
    .example-grid,.try-grid { margin-top:var(--s40); }
  }
  @media (max-width:540px) {
    .header-inner { min-height:80px; gap:10px; }
    .wordmark { font-size:14px; gap:10px; }
    .image-dialog { width:calc(100vw - 20px); max-height:calc(100dvh - 20px); padding:16px; }
    .image-dialog-header { align-items:flex-start; gap:10px; }
    #image-dialog-title { font-size:12px; }
    #presentation-toggle { font-size:12px; padding:10px; max-width:145px; }
    .destinations a { align-items:flex-start; flex-direction:column; gap:10px; }
    .presentation-controls { gap:16px; }
    .presentation-controls .quiet-button { padding:14px 16px; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { html { scroll-behavior:auto; } * { transition-duration:.01ms !important; } }
  @media print {
    body { background:#fff; color:#000; }
    .site-header,.presentation-controls,.copy-button,.button,.skip-link,.image-dialog { display:none !important; }
    .chapter,.presenting .chapter { display:block !important; min-height:0; padding:30px 0; break-after:page; }
    .chapter[hidden] { display:block !important; }
    .muted,.small,.copy > p,.measure,figcaption,.steps span,.prompt-column blockquote { color:#333 !important; }
    .chapter-grid,.example-grid,.try-grid { gap:30px; }
    figure { max-width:600px; margin-top:20px; }
    h1,h2 { font-size:36px; }
    footer { color:#333; }
  }
</style>
